The warm_compaction design: at each compaction, the main model writes the
handoff summary on the cached prefix of its last request, so the server reads
only the new rows. A copy, a port, or a derivative work of this code must keep
this NOTICE as Section 4(d) of the Apache License 2.0 requires.
